  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "_Changed_\n- Tweaks to `AudioFormat.Name` formatting\n- \"MPEG Audio / Layer X\" is now formatted \"MPEG-1 Audio (Layer X)\"\n- Subformats use long names instead of short names (e.g. \"OGG / FLAC\" is now formatted as \"OGG / Free Lossless Audio Codec\")\n- `AudioFormat.ShortName` now follows the same formatting logic as `AudioFormat.Name`\n- MP4/M4A : Better detection of audio properties when the underlying codec is AAC or AC3\n_Fixed_\n- ID3v2.3 : Properly detect multiple values separated by `/0`\n- ID3v2 : Properly take unsynchronized size into account on frames with a little-endian unicode BOM\n- ID3v2 : Properly read picture data inside unsynchronized frames\nThanks to @hsahgal for his multiple contributions to the codebase\n***Binaries are available from nuGet***",
